cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EvidAudit: Regression Testing and Evidence Auditing for AI Agents"
message: "If you use EvidAudit or the accompanying benchmark ledgers, please cite this software."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Mutchi"
    given-names: "Sai Teja"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-15"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SaiTejaMutchi/evidaudit"
url: "https://saitejamutchi.github.io/evidaudit/"
abstract: >-
  EvidAudit is an open-source regression testing and semantic integrity toolkit
  for AI agents and LLM decision pipelines. It detects hidden extraction errors
  behind correct final decisions, tests policy transitions and fresh
  regeneration, and verifies single-field fixes.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - regression-testing
  - llm-evaluation
  - structured-output-validation
  - authorization-testing
  - evidence-auditing
